    "empty.help" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown in the Kinds tab when no definition is picked.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a definition on the left and it appears here. Built-in definitions are read-only (when to use them can be rewritten); the project's own can be written. Add one with +. This is one setting per project and doesn't change per branch. Over MCP, read it with kind_list and kind_read, and write it with kind_create, kind_update and kind_delete."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左で定義を選ぶと、ここに出ます。組み込みの定義は読むだけ（使う場面は書き換えられます）、プロジェクトの定義は書けます。＋ で足します。プロジェクトに 1 つの設定で、branch では変わりません。MCP からは kind_list・kind_read で読み、kind_create・kind_update・kind_delete で書きます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
