    "projectTree.explain" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the heading of the project tree editor in the Kinds tab.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "main_sections is the sections directly under the root of main and of every branch, and board_sections those directly under the board's root (listed as {type, name}, in order). The type workdir makes a working directory (a section read from a folder on this Mac); taking it out removes it (notes in it go to _evacuation_). Saving matches them by name: new names are created, ones taken out are deleted if empty and moved into _evacuation_ if they have content. To rename one, use “Rename…” in the navigator's right-click menu (its content and paths follow; renaming it here deletes it and adds a new one)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "main_sections は main と各 branch の根の直下、board_sections はボードの根の直下のセクションです（{type, name} を並べた順）。type に workdir を書くと作業ディレクトリ（この Mac のフォルダを読むだけのセクション）ができ、外すと消えます（置いたメモは _evacuation_ へ）。保存すると名前で突き合わせ、新しい名前は作り、外したものは空なら消え、中身があれば _evacuation_ へ退避します。名前を変えるのはナビパネルの右クリックの「名前を変える…」で（中身とパスが付いて行きます。ここで名前を書き換えると、消して足したことになります）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
